  {
   "mark": "forum",
   "id": "forum_after",
   "say": "The forum, where the Bituriges made their last stand in wedges, the way Caesar will tell it, until they saw the legionaries going round them along the top of the wall and threw down their arms and ran. They ran for the gates. The Romans had the gates. The rain has washed most of it away, and soldiers have carried off the rest, and the pen in the middle is new."
  },
